# Preview only, never live

Do not deploy user-requested work to production. Do not `git push origin HEAD` to `main` / `master`.

After finishing a change:
- Commit on a preview branch (not `main`)
- Push that branch so Vercel creates a preview deployment
- Send the preview URL in the reply
- Do not merge to `main` or promote the preview to production unless the user explicitly asks

Never force-push `main` / `master`. Still skip secrets (`.env`, credentials).
